-- ("closed": stored balance 0 or none) comes as two id lists, generated from the local database after running
-- seed_ar_legacy_settlements.sql there (2026-11-27): the old-system ids of the invoices / credit memos and payments it settled.
-- The amounts are not copied: each listed document is settled with what is open in THIS database, on its own date, like the
-- local step. Documents no longer open are skipped. Re-runnable (clears its own earlier settlements first).
-- Migration-only (reads legacy_* ids); retired at production with the other seed files.
